{
  "lessonId": "L2M3L4",
  "title": "Calabria 卡拉布里亞",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085 0%,#1abc9c 100%)'><h1>🌊 Calabria</h1><p class='subtitle'>義大利「腳尖」的古老品種寶庫</p></section><section class='slide calabria-map-slide' style='padding:0'><div class='calabria-map-container' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:20px;height:100%;padding:20px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:12px'><div id='calabria-map' class='calabria-region-map' style='border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'></div><div class='map-legend'><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🌊 Calabria 產區地圖</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding:15px;background:rgba(22,160,133,.15);border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #16a085'><p style='margin:0;color:#ecf0f1;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'>義大利腳尖，古老品種寶庫（2500年歷史）</p></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#d4af37;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #d4af37;padding-bottom:8px'>🏆 S級 DOCG</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(212,175,55,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #d4af37'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#d4af37;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#d4af37'>Cirò DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>古希臘奧運選手的酒</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #c0392b;padding-bottom:8px'>⭐ A級產區</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(192,57,43,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #c0392b'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#c0392b;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#c0392b'>Cirò DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>Gaglioppo紅葡萄之王</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(243,156,18,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #f39c12'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#f39c12;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#f39c12'>Greco di Bianco DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>稀有甜白酒，17%+酒精度</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #8e44ad;padding-bottom:8px'>✨ B級產區</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(142,68,173,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #8e44ad'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#8e44ad;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#8e44ad'>Lamezia DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>Magliocco濃郁版本</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(52,152,219,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #3498db'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#3498db;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#3498db'>Bivongi DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>Ionian海岸Passito</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(46,204,113,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #2ecc71'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#2ecc71;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#2ecc71'>Savuto DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>Tyrrhenian海西岸</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🥾 義大利的「腳尖」</h2><div class='region-intro'><div class='intro-text'><p>Calabria（卡拉布里亞）位於義大利半島最南端（「靴子」的<strong>腳尖</strong>部分），夾在<strong>Ionian 海</strong>和<strong>Tyrrhenian 海</strong>之間，擁有<strong>2500 年葡萄酒歷史</strong>，但現代產業落後。</p><p class='highlight'>🍇 Calabria 特點：<strong>古老本土品種的寶庫</strong>（Gaglioppo、Greco Bianco、Magliocco），但產業規模小、國際知名度低。</p></div><div class='calabria-stats'><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>🏺</div><div class='stat-value'>2500 年</div><div class='stat-label'>葡萄酒歷史<br>（古希臘時期）</div></div><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>🍷</div><div class='stat-value'>12 DOC</div><div class='stat-label'>沒有 DOCG<br>（品質認證較少）</div></div><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>🌊</div><div class='stat-value'>800km</div><div class='stat-label'>海岸線<br>（雙海包圍）</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Cirò DOC - Calabria 最知名產區</h2><div class='ciro-section'><div class='ciro-intro'><h3>🏺 古希臘奧運選手的酒</h3><p>Cirò DOC 位於 Calabria 東海岸（Ionian 海），是 Calabria <strong>最古老、最知名</strong>的產區。傳說<strong>古希臘奧運選手</strong>在比賽後會飲用 Cirò 葡萄酒慶祝（當時稱為 Cremissa）。</p></div><div class='ciro-wines'><div class='wine-type rosso'><h4>🍷 Cirò Rosso DOC</h4><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>品種：</strong>Gaglioppo（95%+），可混 Greco Nero、Trebbiano</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>中至飽滿酒體、果香豐富、單寧柔順</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>紅櫻桃、草莓、香料、草本、皮革、礦物</p><p><strong>酒精度：</strong>13-14%</p><p><strong>Classico Superiore Riserva：</strong>陳年 2 年，品質更高</p></div></div><div class='wine-type rosato'><h4>🌸 Cirò Rosato DOC</h4><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>品種：</strong>Gaglioppo（100%）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>清爽、果香、夏季飲用</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>草莓、櫻桃、西瓜、花香</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>Calabria 最受歡迎的粉紅酒</p></div></div><div class='wine-type bianco'><h4>⚪ Cirò Bianco DOC</h4><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>品種：</strong>Greco Bianco（90%+）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>清爽、花香、礦物感</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>檸檬、白桃、杏仁、海鹽</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>產量較小，不如紅酒知名</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Gaglioppo - Calabria 的紅葡萄之王</h2><div class='gaglioppo-section'><div class='gaglioppo-intro'><h3>🍷 被低估的優質品種</h3><p>Gaglioppo 是 Calabria 的<strong>代表性紅葡萄品種</strong>，佔該區紅酒產量 80%+，但長期被忽視，近年重獲重視。</p></div><div class='gaglioppo-features'><div class='feature-box'><h4>🍇 品種特性</h4><ul><li><strong>顏色：</strong>相對較淡（類似 Pinot Noir、Nebbiolo）</li><li><strong>單寧：</strong>中等、柔順</li><li><strong>酸度：</strong>中至高</li><li><strong>酒精度：</strong>13-14%</li><li><strong>成熟期：</strong>中晚熟（9 月底-10 月初）</li><li><strong>抗旱性：</strong>強（適合炎熱氣候）</li></ul></div><div class='feature-box'><h4>🍷 風味特徵</h4><p><strong>年輕時：</strong>紅櫻桃、草莓、覆盆莓、紫羅蘭、香料</p><p><strong>陳年後（5-10 年）：</strong>皮革、煙草、乾花、礦物、草本</p><p class='note'>💡 Gaglioppo 被稱為「南義的 Pinot Noir」，因顏色較淡、單寧柔順、風味細膩。</p></div><div class='feature-box'><h4>🌟 頂級生產者</h4><ul><li><strong>Librandi</strong>（Gravello - Gaglioppo + Cabernet 混釀）</li><li><strong>A Vita</strong>（自然派）</li><li><strong>Ippolito 1845</strong>（歷史悠久）</li><li><strong>Ceraudo</strong>（有機、生物動力法）</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 其他 Calabria 本土品種</h2><div class='native-grapes'><div class='grape-card red'><h3>🔴 Magliocco</h3><div class='grape-info'><p><strong>類型：</strong>紅葡萄品種</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>濃郁、果香爆炸、單寧高</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>黑櫻桃、黑莓、李子、巧克力、香料</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>顏色極深、酒精度高（14-15%）</p><p><strong>產區：</strong>Lamezia DOC</p><p><strong>用途：</strong>單一品種酒或與 Gaglioppo 混釀增加顏色和濃郁度</p></div></div><div class='grape-card white'><h3>⚪ Greco Bianco</h3><div class='grape-info'><p><strong>類型：</strong>白葡萄品種（不同於 Campania 的 Greco di Tufo）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>果香豐富、酒體飽滿、陳年潛力佳</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>白桃、杏桃、柑橘、蜂蜜、杏仁、礦物</p><p><strong>產區：</strong>Greco di Bianco DOC（甜酒版本）</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>Calabria 最高品質的白葡萄品種</p></div></div><div class='grape-card white'><h3>⚪ Mantonico</h3><div class='grape-info'><p><strong>類型：</strong>白葡萄品種</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>芳香、果香豐富、可釀造甜酒</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>柑橘、白花、蜂蜜、杏桃</p><p><strong>產區：</strong>Bivongi DOC</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>適合釀造晚採收甜酒（Passito）</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍯 Greco di Bianco DOC - 稀有的甜白酒</h2><div class='greco-bianco-section'><div class='greco-intro'><h3>🍯 義大利最古老的甜酒之一</h3><p>Greco di Bianco DOC 產自 Calabria 最南端的<strong>Bianco 小鎮</strong>，是義大利<strong>最稀有、最古老的甜白酒</strong>之一，產量極小。</p></div><div class='greco-details'><div class='detail-card'><h4>🍇 釀造方式</h4><p><strong>品種：</strong>Greco Bianco（100%）</p><p><strong>方法：</strong>葡萄風乾（Appassimento）或晚採收</p><p><strong>風乾時間：</strong>1-2 週</p><p><strong>殘糖：</strong>100-150 g/L</p><p><strong>酒精度：</strong>17%+（極高）</p></div><div class='detail-card'><h4>🍷 風味特徵</h4><p><strong>顏色：</strong>金黃色至琥珀色</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>杏桃乾、蜂蜜、橙花、柑橘皮、焦糖、堅果</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>甜美、濃郁、復雜、陳年潛力 10-20 年</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>義大利最甜、最濃郁的甜白酒之一</p></div><div class='detail-card'><h4>🍽️ 配餐</h4><ul><li>🍰 傳統義式甜點</li><li>🧀 藍紋起司、Gorgonzola</li><li>🥮 堅果塔、杏仁餅</li><li>🍫 黑巧克力</li><li>🍊 柑橘類甜點</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 其他重要 Calabria DOC</h2><div class='other-docs'><div class='doc-card'><h3>Lamezia DOC</h3><div class='doc-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Lamezia Terme（Calabria 中部）</p><p><strong>紅酒品種：</strong>Gaglioppo、Magliocco、Greco Nero</p><p><strong>白酒品種：</strong>Greco Bianco、Mantonico</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>紅酒濃郁、果香豐富</p></div></div><div class='doc-card'><h3>Bivongi DOC</h3><div class='doc-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Calabria 南部（Ionian 海岸）</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>允許紅、白、Passito 甜酒</p><p><strong>主要品種：</strong>Gaglioppo、Greco Bianco、Mantonico</p></div></div><div class='doc-card'><h3>Savuto DOC</h3><div class='doc-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Calabria 西海岸（Tyrrhenian 海）</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Gaglioppo（主導）+ Magliocco、Sangiovese</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>輕至中等酒體、易飲</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍽️ Calabria 美食與配餐</h2><div class='calabria-cuisine'><div class='cuisine-intro'><h3>🌶️ 辣味海鮮與 'Nduja</h3><p>Calabria 料理以<strong>辣椒、海鮮、劍魚、'Nduja 辣味抹醬香腸</strong>為特色，風格熱情、香料重。</p></div><div class='food-grid'><div class='food-card'><h4>🌶️ 'Nduja</h4><p class='dish-desc'>Calabria 超辣抹醬香腸（可塗麵包）</p><p><strong>成分：</strong>豬肉、辣椒、鹽</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Cirò Rosso Classico Superiore</li><li>Gaglioppo Riserva</li></ul></div><div class='food-card'><h4>🐟 Pesce Spada（劍魚）</h4><p class='dish-desc'>Calabria 海鮮代表（燒烤或燉煮）</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Cirò Bianco</li><li>Greco Bianco</li></ul></div><div class='food-card'><h4>🍝 Fileja con 'Nduja</h4><p class='dish-desc'>手工麵條配 'Nduja 辣醬</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Cirò Rosato（清爽解辣）</li><li>Gaglioppo</li></ul></div><div class='food-card'><h4>🧀 Caciocavallo Silano DOP</h4><p class='dish-desc'>Calabria 傳統拉絲起司</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Cirò Rosso</li><li>Greco di Bianco（甜酒配陳年起司）</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Calabria 位於義大利「腳尖」，擁有 2500 年葡萄酒歷史</div><div class='point'>✓ Cirò DOC 是 Calabria 最知名產區，傳說是古希臘奧運選手的酒</div><div class='point'>✓ Gaglioppo 是 Calabria 代表紅葡萄品種，被稱為「南義的 Pinot Noir」</div><div class='point'>✓ Greco di Bianco DOC 是義大利最稀有的甜白酒之一，酒精度 17%+</div><div class='point'>✓ Magliocco 是濃郁、顏色深的紅葡萄品種</div><div class='point'>✓ 'Nduja 是 Calabria 超辣抹醬香腸，完美搭配 Cirò Rosso</div></div></section></div><style>.region-intro{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.intro-text{margin-bottom:25px}.intro-text p{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 15px}.highlight{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d1f2eb,#a3e4d7);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #16a085;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}.calabria-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.stat-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1abc9c,#16a085);padding:30px 25px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.stat-icon{font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:12px}.stat-value{font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px}.stat-label{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;opacity:.95}.ciro-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.ciro-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d6eaf8,#ebf5fb);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.ciro-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.4rem}.ciro-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.ciro-wines{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.wine-type{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid}.wine-type.rosso{border-color:#c0392b}.wine-type.rosato{border-color:#e91e63}.wine-type.bianco{border-color:#3498db}.wine-type h4{margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.2rem}.wine-type.rosso h4{color:#c0392b}.wine-type.rosato h4{color:#e91e63}.wine-type.bianco h4{color:#3498db}.wine-info p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.wine-info strong{color:#2c3e50}.gaglioppo-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.gaglioppo-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fadbd8,#fce4ec);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.gaglioppo-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.4rem}.gaglioppo-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.gaglioppo-features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.feature-box{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid #c0392b}.feature-box h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.1rem}.feature-box ul{margin:10px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.9}.feature-box p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.feature-box .note{background:#d5f4e6;border-left:4px solid #27ae60;padding:10px 15px;margin-top:15px;border-radius:6px}.feature-box strong{color:#2c3e50}.native-grapes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.grape-card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid}.grape-card.red{border-color:#c0392b}.grape-card.white{border-color:#3498db}.grape-card h3{margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.2rem}.grape-card.red h3{color:#c0392b}.grape-card.white h3{color:#3498db}.grape-info p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.grape-info strong{color:#2c3e50}.greco-bianco-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.greco-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef5e7,#fdebd0);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.greco-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.4rem}.greco-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.greco-details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.detail-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid #f39c12}.detail-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.1rem}.detail-card p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.detail-card ul{margin:10px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.9}.detail-card strong{color:#2c3e50}.other-docs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.doc-card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid #16a085}.doc-card h3{margin:0 0 15px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.2rem}.doc-info p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.doc-info strong{color:#2c3e50}.calabria-cuisine{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.cuisine-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3cd,#ffe69c);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.cuisine-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#d35400;font-size:1.3rem}.cuisine-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.food-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px}.food-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #d35400}.food-card h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:#d35400;font-size:1.1rem}.dish-desc{color:#7f8c8d;font-style:italic;margin:0 0 15px;font-size:.95rem}.food-card p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.food-card ul{margin:5px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.9}.food-card strong{color:#2c3e50}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d1f2eb,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #16a085;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style>",
